### 1. Thêm thú cưng (POST)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
"owner_id": 1,
"name": "Mimi",
"species": "Mèo",
"breed": "Mèo Anh",
"weight": 3.5
}

### 2. Xem danh sách thú cưng (GET)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pets
Accept: application/json

### 3. Test xếp lồng hợp lệ (BR-03)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/boarding/assign
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
"pet_id": 1,
"cage_id": 1,
"check_in": "2026-11-10 10:00:00"
}